  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.3.0: No public API or behaviour change. Traces the Dafny header length rule to RFC 6455 and makes the header tests fail when the check they name is removed. Adds test parity for reserved bits and opcodes, the frame size limit and truncated headers, and a rejected-handshake test that no longer depends on a race. Adopts small internal types at the verified core boundary, with no measured cost. See README.md and verification/README.md.",
